WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.768
Hi, everyone. This is Sally.

2
00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:06.006
I'm originally from Long Island, New York,
and I'm currently a fourth year student

3
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.209
majoring in Business Administration
at our Tepper School

4
00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:12.312
with an additional major
in French and Francophone Studies.

5
00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:17.312
I actually had a chance to study abroad
in Paris in the spring semester of 2025,

6
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.587
and it was honestly
one of my favorite experiences

7
00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:23.456
and resources
that I utilize through CMU here.

8
00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.493
I think we're really surprised me
the most was how manageable

9
00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.861
the whole process was.

10
00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.929
We provide a lot of support here,

11
00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.732
so it did not feel overwhelming
to plan all my coursework.

12
00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.201
Every student who's interested in
studying abroad

13
00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.604
will have their own study abroad advisor

14
00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.105
who will guide them through everything.

15
00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:41.941
Academically, it was also very meaningful

16
00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:45.779
since I do have an additional major
in French and Francophone studies, so

17
00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:50.250
I was actually able to use that language
in everyday life, not just in a classroom.

18
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.620
and especially given that it was actually
my first time in France.

19
00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.557
Even simple things like ordering food
or navigating the city

20
00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:00.126
felt like part of the all learning experience.

21
00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:03.696
This definitely pushed me out of my comfort zone,
but in a really good way.

22
00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:07.200
Even until today, I still miss
that experience and miss the city

23
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:11.337
very much and I cannot recommend this
enough to anyone who's interested.

